  "prefLabel": "Gen 303.03 Documents Required of Applicants For Provisional Licensure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gen 303.03 Documents Required of Applicants For Provisional Licensure. Applicants for provisional licensure shall provide, or arrange for the OPLC to receive, the following documents supporting their applications:\n\n(a) Documentation that the applicant has been authorized to take a certification exam by a certifying agency; and\n\n(b) The supervision form described in Gen 306.06.\n\nSource. #10686, eff 10-7-14; ss by #13555, eff 4-11-23 (formerly Gen 303.05); ss by #14337, eff 10-7-25, EXPIRES: 10-7-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/gen300.html"
